WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Do you still have this kind of rag?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,880
Is salted fish out?

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:09,650
Where is the trash can? I'm going to pick it up for grandpa.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,170
Are you still missing a granddaughter?

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,810
Go to college and have a smooth brain

6
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:18,940
The kind of grandpa who can eat, poop and play with mobile phones

7
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:20,540
I like to take it with me tomorrow

8
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,020
The big radish is also held

9
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:23,340
Take a bite when you're hungry

10
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:27,930
My grandfather’s Pei Youyou

11
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,520
Who else saw your grandpa’s birthday party?

12
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,000
Who is Pei Youyou

13
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:33,020
Youyou's surname is Lu

14
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,760
Same last name as grandma

15
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,760
You scold Pei Youyou

16
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:38,440
What does it have to do with me, Lu Youyou?

17
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,040
You are the blood of our Pei family

18
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:41,840
There's no point in taking someone else's last name

19
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,880
You have forgotten your roots

20
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:50,570
Then you can take your surname as Youyou, your old man, grandpa

21
00:00:50,850 --> 00:00:52,770
Did you say the wrong thing?

22
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:54,170
There's nothing wrong with it

23
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:55,610
Your last name is Lu

24
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,050
I should have known that Youyou was at Pei's house

25
00:00:57,050 --> 00:00:58,170
Embarrassed by this

26
00:00:58,290 --> 00:00:59,290
I should stay up all night

27
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:00,730
Smuggled in sacks

28
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:02,860
Feeling comfortable

29
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,220
This just feels so much better

30
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:05,220
If everything is clear first

31
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:06,140
Yoyo Lu Ming

32
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:07,140
Match of ten

33
00:01:07,140 --> 00:01:08,660
Lu Youyou sounds so nice

34
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,900
If Zai Zai doesn't make a sound, he will become a blockbuster.

35
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:12,380
Don’t you look down on Yoyo?

36
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:14,060
I have no intention of taking your last name at all.
